erent ways the us dollar is still  the strongest most sought after fiat  currency in the world  and it will strengthen against a basket  of other fiat currencies it's exactly  what we're seeing play out right now  ultimately fiat currencies they all have  an unlimited supply and they continue to  be debased at historic pace  but there is a race which countries and  which central banks will strengthen  their currencies faster than others  and which countries and central banks  will weaken their currencies faster than  all the others there's a lot of movement  right now in the currency world the  ground is shifting beneath us  and most people especially the bitcoin  community they're sitting back and  they're watching all this play out and  they're saying there's got to be a  better way
 

